<title>USA: D. Witter /M. Stanley research merge.</title>
<headline>D. Witter /M. Stanley research merge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The equity research departments at Morgan Stanley Group Inc and Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co have combined, according to a Morgan Stanley spokesman.</p>
<p>The combination occurred on Monday, although the formal merger between the two firms is pending.</p>
